ng = (d_cur * d_cur + d_dep_cur * d_dep_cur - d_dep * d_dep) / denom\n    cos_ang = np.clip(cos_ang, -1.0, 1.0)\n    # Penalize turning back toward the depot (cos>0 means pointing away from depot\n    # along the radial direction is preferred; we reward outward continuation).\n    angular_penalty = 1.0 - cos_ang  # 0 = straight outward, 2 = straight back\n\n    norm_dist = d_cur / scale\n    load_frac = dem / cap\n\n    # Primary: sweep outward with mild distance and demand-fill influence.\n    primary = 0.5 * norm_dist + 0.6 * angular_penalty - 0.25 * load_frac\n\n    best = float(np.min(primary))\n    band = max(abs(best), 1e-9) * 0.05 + 1e-9\n    in_band = primary <= best + band\n\n    # Local-density tie-break: prefer nodes whose neighbors are also unvisited\n    # (encourages customers to be served while the truck is in their cluster).\n    sub = distance_matrix[np.ix_(unvisited_nodes, unvisited_nodes)]\n    # Count of other unvisited nodes within a small radius scaled by mean demand.\n    radius = 0.25 * scale\n    neighbors = np.sum((sub < radius).astype(float), axis=1) - 1.0\n    density = np.maximum(neighbors, 0.0) / max(float(unvisited_nodes.size), 1.0)\n\n    secondary = np.where(in_band, -density - 0.15 * load_frac, np.inf)\n\n    return int(unvisited_nodes[np.argmin(secondary)])","code_sha256":"0a1ded209ee52a7fb74abeafb7878611e5c86fcefdaa56ef7806053f801abeff","elapsed_seconds":0.219,"error_code":"forbidden_attribute","error_detail":"ix_","evaluation_id":"68ec8792bdf64c569507c533db569bad","generation_parents":[{"algorithm":"The new algorithm uses a two-stage savings-based priority: primary score ranks candidates by the \"savings\" of inserting them now (depot-cost minus detour-cost weighted by load), and if a candidate returns strongly toward the depot direction it gets a mild boost, breaking away from the distance+depot+load quadratic mix of the incumbents.","code_sha256":"92b31f34fe0222867061cf4ccd7f54138f0a417d94374356e4772d89d9990ad5","population_mem